<title>THAILAND: Thai exchange halts trade in One Holding.</title>
<headline>Thai exchange halts trade in One Holding.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand halted trade in the shares and warrants of troubled One Holding Ltd on Friday while awaiting a disclosure of information from the company.</p>
<p>Advisers are working on plans to rescue the ailing company which failed to meet payments on two bills of exchange worth $13.5 million in March.</p>
<p>The exchange did not detail the information awaited from the firm.</p>
</text>
